window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Sacrifices must be made as the secrets of the seven kingdoms unravel.</b></p> <p>On the day of her wedding, Kalisandre's world erupts into flames once again. Now, entangled in a web of deceit and betrayal, she struggles to find who she is and what she is fighting for. With her trust having been broken one too many times, will she find the strength to reclaim her voice, or will she succumb to the inferno surrounding her?</p> <p>Meanwhile, Graeson and his friends flee Frenzia, overwhelmed by exhaustion and grief. With war looming over the horizon, their quest to convince Kalisandre of the truth will prove to be a more daunting task than they had anticipated.</p> <p>As friendships and alliances are tested, everyone must confront their darkest truths while navigating a world rife with betrayal.</p> <p><i>The third installment of the new adult romantic fantasy series Of Fire and Lies explores the complexities of love, trust, and the perilous nature of loyalty in the face of conflict.</i></p>"; 
